        "created_at": "2020-12-26T18:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had one glorious game where this happened and about 6 towns and a couple of cities just keeled over dead.&nbsp; Between Mist's usual rule and all the destroyed invaders, I remember it was 15 fear during that one cleanup phase.</p>",
